  "description": "<p>When space and weight are concerns, the Amplify 900 Synthetic Sleeping Bag is the answer. Ideal for summer or spring backpacking and hiking with new Amplify (expand) technology in knee and hip area to minimise heat loss. With a comfort rating of 7°C and transition rating of 2°C, this is a great three season sleeping bag. It also features a reflective zip puller and internal pocket for valuables.</p>\n<p><em>This sleeping bag <strong>comes with a</strong> <strong>right-side zip</strong>. A left-side zip is available <strong>on request</strong>.</em></p>",
